data.value:
Organize {0} previewed files and monitor this folder for completed downloads?

{1}

Future and currently unfinished downloads will also be organized. Aging files will move to Expiring Files for your review. No files will be deleted automatically.

Move {0} to:

{1}

Dowlume will stop monitoring this file. Existing files will not be overwritten.

Check this folder every {0} minutes?

{1}

The first pass waits for the interval. Each pass organizes completed downloads, including files added after this preview, and moves aging files to Expiring Files. Busy and unfinished downloads are skipped. No files will be deleted automatically. You can turn monitoring off at any time. Automatic startup requires your saved opt-in preference.
